#: src/app/[lang]/privacy-policy/page.tsx:36
msgid "Budgie (\"we,\" \"our,\" or \"us\") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application and website (collectively, the \"Service\"). We are a privacy-first financial tracking application that operates on an offline-first basis, meaning your financial data stays on your device."
msgstr ""

